      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Wonderful working with Sunny Solar, a local company that has met all my needs. From the visit by Rick who runs the team that installed the system to the administration team who completed all the paperwork required after the install. The company worked with me to arrange installation of the system in conjunction with having a new roof istalled prior to the solar. They attended to decommission my old system and then reattened once the roof was installed without any additional cost.  A piece of the ridging was damaged during the install. However, I was impressed with the honesty of Sunny Solar who contacted the roofer and advised this needed to be repaired and reduced the cost of the repair from my overall cost. The Powercore inspector quickly signed off on the install and commented on the quality of the work completed by Sunny Solar compared to other installations he has seen. Is reassuring to know I have dealt with and supported a local company and electricians.",
