      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "All three installation companies sent reps on site to quote for our 6.6kw system. After receiving the quotes I created a spreadsheet to compare like for like system quotes. I contacted all three again before selecting Sunny Solar for the job. They weren’t the cheapest but felt they had my long term needs in mind and were the only ones to offer a new switchboard, instead of an add-on, which made the decision easier. We chose their recommended Trina solar panels and Sungrow inverter. Sales rep Mark was also most helpful assisting with black framed panels and rails to give us a matching finish on our black tiled roof. Kirsten contacted me several times to confirm dates and times, as did Rick and his team of installers re arrival time on the day and I was aware of every step of the installation Rick showed me how to i use the iSolar app which gives live info of energy being generated and used. The job was completed safely with no mess left behind. Overall the whole team at Sunny Solar were a pleasure to deal with and I have no hesitation recommending them to anyone on the Bellarine looking to install a solar panel system.",
